WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:08.920
SAY NO TO PIRACY SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:34.280 --> 01:38.920
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:42.000 --> 01:43.720
-Hello, sir!
-Come and have a look!

01:43.800 --> 01:46.040
-That's nice.
-Have a look!

01:46.120 --> 01:48.360
-I do like the color.
-Yes.

01:48.440 --> 01:50.560
It looks so nice.

01:55.520 --> 01:57.960
Hey, sir. I will have one.

01:58.040 --> 02:00.040
Pick me a good one.

02:00.120 --> 02:01.360
Of course.

02:01.440 --> 02:03.680
Thank you. Take care.

02:05.960 --> 02:06.800
Get lost!

02:13.680 --> 02:15.440
The world can change in an instant.

02:15.520 --> 02:16.960
Once, deadly foes.

02:17.040 --> 02:18.200
Hereafter, we are of one aim.

02:18.920 --> 02:22.080
Even bitter enemies can become allies.

02:26.480 --> 02:28.920
Since when does a snake
have good intentions?

02:30.440 --> 02:33.840
General Qi, you care nothing for wealth
or power.

02:34.360 --> 02:36.440
The only thing you desire is her.

02:37.240 --> 02:39.320
You know she's your buddy's wife,

02:39.400 --> 02:41.760
yet you can't stay away from her.

02:42.840 --> 02:45.840
Why? You simply can't help yourself.

02:47.160 --> 02:49.560
You know exactly what I mean.

02:50.640 --> 02:52.400
Who do you think you are?

02:53.120 --> 02:54.360
You think you can read my mind?

02:55.040 --> 02:57.200
Because I was on the city wall
that day, too.

02:58.600 --> 03:00.840
Such breathtaking beauty…

03:00.920 --> 03:02.280
HENGCHENG GATE

03:02.360 --> 03:03.680
Brighter than gold or jewels.

03:03.760 --> 03:05.920
More tempting than power itself.

03:06.000 --> 03:08.200
Enough to make a man's very soul tremble.

03:08.960 --> 03:10.240
Qi Zhongkai.

03:11.000 --> 03:14.040
No one in this world understands you
better than I do.

03:21.640 --> 03:25.440
Everything in this world has its price.

03:27.080 --> 03:30.600
If a deal falls through, it's just
that the offer wasn't sweet enough.

03:31.320 --> 03:33.120
Well, General Qi?

03:34.400 --> 03:36.920
I wonder if Noble Lady Wu'an

03:39.080 --> 03:41.120
is tempting enough for you.

04:11.720 --> 04:14.320
ZHAOYANG PALACE

04:17.040 --> 04:19.279
Your Majesty,
those elixirs are poisoning you.

04:22.760 --> 04:24.280
You're worrying over nothing.

04:26.240 --> 04:27.280
Brother!

04:27.360 --> 04:29.120
-Don't stop me!
-Brother!

04:29.200 --> 04:31.320
-I need to see Father!
-It hasn't been verified yet.

04:31.400 --> 04:33.640
Keep it down. Don't sully
the Crown Prince's reputation.

04:33.720 --> 04:34.920
Father!

04:35.000 --> 04:36.680
What's with all this pushing and pulling?

04:36.760 --> 04:38.120
Have you no sense of decorum?

04:40.760 --> 04:41.840
Your Majesty's health is at stake.

04:42.440 --> 04:43.760
I was beside myself with worry.

04:43.840 --> 04:45.800
Forgive my disrespect, Father.

04:46.400 --> 04:47.320
Father.

04:47.880 --> 04:49.880
A palace maid
from Furong Hall has reported

04:49.960 --> 04:52.760
that Lady Zheng replaced Solomon's seal

04:53.280 --> 04:54.720
with poisonous gelsemium
in the ginseng soup.

04:58.000 --> 04:59.360
What's gelsemium?

04:59.440 --> 05:02.280
Gelsemium is also called poison root.

05:02.360 --> 05:04.040
They look the same.

05:04.120 --> 05:05.960
But Solomon's seal nourishes,
while gelsemium is poisonous.

05:06.040 --> 05:08.000
It's especially deadly with cinnabar.

05:08.080 --> 05:09.960
Father's been taking
cinnabar elixirs for years.

05:10.480 --> 05:12.360
The ginseng soup
makes the poison stronger.

05:12.880 --> 05:15.880
Within days,
you'll bleed from every orifice.

05:16.600 --> 05:18.400
And no medicine can save you!

05:20.320 --> 05:22.800
Your Majesty, this ginseng soup

05:23.400 --> 05:25.520
strengthens the body
and restores vitality.

05:26.360 --> 05:29.080
You really should drink more of it.

05:37.360 --> 05:39.320
The medicinal smell is too strong.

05:39.400 --> 05:40.600
I simply can't get used to it.

05:55.120 --> 05:58.240
Father! I truly knew nothing about this!

05:58.320 --> 05:59.960
Please believe me, Father!

06:00.560 --> 06:01.640
Your Majesty!

06:01.720 --> 06:04.040
These accusations are lies!

06:04.560 --> 06:06.840
Prince Fu resents my son
becoming Crown Prince.

06:06.920 --> 06:10.120
He's been plotting to frame him!

06:10.880 --> 06:13.320
Which wretched maid
in my palace accused me?

06:13.400 --> 06:15.480
Does she dare confront me face-to-face?

06:25.640 --> 06:26.600
Your Highness.

06:26.680 --> 06:27.840
His Majesty is rewarding you

06:27.920 --> 06:30.240
with Solomon's seal ginseng soup
and a golden elixir.

07:10.840 --> 07:13.200
Your Majesty,
don't make things hard for Shou.

07:13.760 --> 07:17.400
He's always been your favorite son.

07:20.400 --> 07:22.280
He may have his faults,

07:24.120 --> 07:27.360
but they're merely romantic indiscretions.

07:28.120 --> 07:30.920
He'd never risk his life over them.

07:31.680 --> 07:33.360
This is all my fault.

07:34.120 --> 07:37.680
I couldn't stand watching
that woman Zhou Fu grow so arrogant!

07:38.200 --> 07:40.040
She's nothing
but a lowly wet nurse's daughter,

07:40.120 --> 07:42.440
yet she dared claim equal
standing with me,

07:42.520 --> 07:44.200
the daughter of a Grand Commandant!

07:46.080 --> 07:49.000
I was humiliated in public before,

07:49.080 --> 07:51.360
and Your Majesty believed only her side.

07:52.040 --> 07:56.880
I was mistreated and humiliated!

07:58.120 --> 08:01.600
How could I possibly bear it,
Your Majesty?

08:21.160 --> 08:24.320
Your Majesty.
What has Shou done to deserve this?

08:24.960 --> 08:28.080
Prince Fu is trying
to frame the Crown Prince.

08:28.160 --> 08:31.560
He wants to take his place, Your Majesty!

08:32.400 --> 08:36.000
Are you really going to have
another son killed?

08:36.080 --> 08:37.039
Your Majesty!

08:38.440 --> 08:40.799
Father, I'm innocent!

08:40.880 --> 08:44.159
I've been falsely accused! I'm innocent!

08:44.240 --> 08:45.440
Father!

08:46.720 --> 08:49.720
-What has Shou done wrong?
-I'm innocent!

08:52.120 --> 08:54.160
-What has Shou done wrong?
-Guards!

08:57.720 --> 09:01.560
Your Majesty!

09:01.640 --> 09:05.160
What has Shou done to deserve this?

09:05.240 --> 09:08.320
What has Shou done wrong?

09:16.280 --> 09:17.280
Go back.

09:20.000 --> 09:21.880
You should be grateful to your mother.

09:22.640 --> 09:24.600
She may be foolish and shortsighted,

09:26.360 --> 09:28.040
but when your life was on the line,

09:29.400 --> 09:31.160
she was willing to die for you.

09:32.520 --> 09:33.600
She was right.

09:34.640 --> 09:35.480
I…

09:36.280 --> 09:38.280
I don't want to lose another son.

09:41.120 --> 09:45.920
From now on, know your place
and be grateful for what you have.

10:00.200 --> 10:02.800
CROWN PRINCE'S RESIDENCE

10:04.760 --> 10:06.640
Perhaps tomorrow.

10:06.720 --> 10:08.040
Perhaps next month.

10:10.640 --> 10:14.000
His Majesty will strip you of your title
whenever the mood strikes him.

10:15.320 --> 10:20.640
How can a cripple who's lost his favor
ever inherit the throne?

10:21.640 --> 10:23.040
This is all Wu'an's fault.

10:24.880 --> 10:25.880
Your Highness.

10:33.840 --> 10:35.760
His Majesty hasn't deposed you, after all.

10:36.440 --> 10:38.520
You still have a chance to fight back.

10:43.840 --> 10:45.840
Traitors have corrupted the realm.

10:45.920 --> 10:47.640
That's why Heaven sent this plague.

10:49.520 --> 10:50.720
You're the Crown Prince.

10:50.800 --> 10:52.840
You must rid the court of corruption,

10:52.920 --> 10:54.680
save the people from suffering,

10:54.760 --> 10:56.840
and achieve something truly great.

11:00.360 --> 11:01.680
Who are these traitors?

11:01.760 --> 11:03.280
Isn't it obvious?

11:03.360 --> 11:05.720
Lady Li, of course,
and her daughter, Lady Wu'an.

11:05.800 --> 11:08.080
They've brought ruin to the realm.

11:09.160 --> 11:11.240
If you want to eliminate these traitors,

11:12.000 --> 11:14.440
you must get rid of Lu Zhuo first.

11:44.720 --> 11:47.040
This is a secret letter from Lord Han.

11:52.120 --> 11:55.680
DIMAN, KING OF HUTUO

11:56.680 --> 11:58.920
The last time
I allied with the Han family,

11:59.000 --> 12:01.080
I lost many of my men.

12:01.680 --> 12:06.000
So this time, why should I agree?

12:08.040 --> 12:09.440
Your Majesty's three defeats

12:09.520 --> 12:12.720
were the work of the Lu family,
keeping you from Yunzhong and Yanmen.

12:12.800 --> 12:14.640
They're your greatest threat.

12:15.240 --> 12:17.560
If this plan succeeds,
that threat will be gone.

12:19.360 --> 12:20.520
Take a look, Your Majesty.

12:21.800 --> 12:23.280
Once my master takes power,

12:23.360 --> 12:25.280
he is willing to offer
Youbeiping Commandery.

12:25.360 --> 12:27.840
Lands with plenty of water and grass,
where the herds grow fat.

12:27.920 --> 12:30.280
Let it be lent to Your Majesty
for ten years of grazing.

12:37.800 --> 12:41.120
Good. Now that's a fine deal!

12:41.200 --> 12:43.320
YANMEN, YUNZHONG, YOUBEIPING

12:43.400 --> 12:45.360
Urgent military dispatch!

12:45.440 --> 12:46.760
Urgent military dispatch!

12:46.840 --> 12:49.480
Make way! Urgent dispatch!

12:50.000 --> 12:51.720
Urgent dispatch!

12:51.800 --> 12:53.640
ZHAO

12:55.600 --> 12:58.200
The Hutuo have terrorized
our northern border for decades.

12:58.280 --> 12:59.800
Countless people have suffered.

12:59.880 --> 13:01.800
I've had enough!

13:01.880 --> 13:02.720
Lu Zhuo.

13:03.360 --> 13:05.160
I command you to lead our armies

13:05.920 --> 13:09.280
north to secure the border
and crush the invaders.

13:09.880 --> 13:12.760
Do not let me down.

13:14.200 --> 13:17.200
I will do everything in my power
to secure the border

13:17.280 --> 13:18.720
and keep our people safe.

13:24.600 --> 13:27.160
The situation is critical.

13:27.240 --> 13:29.240
Leave the capital at once. No delays.

13:30.520 --> 13:31.600
Yes, Your Majesty.

13:32.520 --> 13:34.800
ZHAO

13:42.520 --> 13:43.720
Lu Zhuo.

13:45.080 --> 13:47.920
I'm entrusting the fate of our dynasty
entirely to you.

13:48.000 --> 13:49.840
If the situation becomes dire,

13:50.360 --> 13:53.800
you have my authority
to act as you see fit.

13:54.440 --> 13:58.200
I'll give my life if I must
to repay Your Majesty's trust.

14:02.200 --> 14:03.040
Zhuo.

14:03.640 --> 14:05.680
Watch out for those plotting against you.

14:08.160 --> 14:10.960
Han Liao is eager to redeem himself
and restore his family's honor.

14:11.480 --> 14:13.320
He's even willing to serve under you.

14:14.520 --> 14:16.040
Why turn him away?

14:16.720 --> 14:17.680
Who knows?

14:18.920 --> 14:20.280
He might prove quite useful.

14:20.360 --> 14:21.720
Useful?

14:24.480 --> 14:25.480
Han Liao?

14:26.320 --> 14:28.440
Go ahead and enjoy your little triumph.

14:28.520 --> 14:33.560
The one who knows you best
will be your greatest enemy.

14:33.640 --> 14:34.720
I'm off to the battlefield

14:34.800 --> 14:36.360
this time to earn the ultimate glory

14:36.960 --> 14:38.240
I'll show the world

14:38.320 --> 14:40.720
Lu Zhuo isn't the only hero
in the Lu family!

14:51.000 --> 14:52.640
Your Ladyship, Lord Lu leaves by decree.

14:52.720 --> 14:53.920
The situation is urgent.

14:54.000 --> 14:55.880
He sent me to apologize
for his sudden departure.

16:23.280 --> 16:24.200
It's all right.

16:24.280 --> 16:25.520
-Forget it.
-Go on.

16:32.400 --> 16:34.800
Rao. Don't worry.

16:34.880 --> 16:36.160
My brother will win.

16:36.760 --> 16:38.480
He's never lost a battle in his life.

16:42.960 --> 16:43.720
Thank you.

16:47.760 --> 16:50.080
Rao. He'll come home safe.

16:50.160 --> 16:51.200
Don't worry.

17:00.800 --> 17:02.240
He didn't even say goodbye.

17:03.360 --> 17:04.520
Like I'm worried about him.

17:05.640 --> 17:07.359
I wonder how far the army has gotten.

17:08.359 --> 17:09.599
Have they won yet?

17:12.920 --> 17:13.920
Get back to work.

17:17.359 --> 17:19.079
Like I'm worried about him.

17:29.760 --> 17:31.760
The enemy is gathering east of Longcheng.

17:32.960 --> 17:34.200
At dawn, three days from now,

17:34.280 --> 17:37.400
I'll personally lead our armored cavalry
in an assault on their main forces.

17:38.080 --> 17:39.920
-Generals of the Left and Right.
-Yes, sir!

17:40.480 --> 17:43.520
Each of you will lead 10000
cavalry archers to support our flanks.

17:43.600 --> 17:44.760
Qi Zhongkai.

17:45.320 --> 17:46.760
Take 10000 soldiers upstream

17:47.280 --> 17:48.360
and set an ambush.

17:48.960 --> 17:49.960
Cut off their retreat to the north.

17:51.520 --> 17:52.720
Yes, General!

17:56.960 --> 17:59.000
Brother. What about my assignment?

17:59.080 --> 18:00.280
Lu Ya.

18:00.920 --> 18:03.600
This is a military camp,
not a place for you to do as you please.

18:03.680 --> 18:06.120
General! Grandfather sent me here
to gain experience.

18:06.200 --> 18:07.120
But you've given me an empty title!

18:07.720 --> 18:08.800
I want to fight. Let me!

18:08.880 --> 18:11.720
Lu Ya.
Your brother is looking out for you.

18:11.800 --> 18:13.200
Never reckless in battles.

18:13.280 --> 18:14.120
Go back and cool off.

18:14.200 --> 18:15.920
Are you afraid I'll steal your spotlight?

18:16.000 --> 18:17.280
Don't touch me!

18:21.400 --> 18:23.360
Second Young Master. My Lord!

18:26.040 --> 18:28.000
He's young.
It's only natural he's hotheaded.

18:28.520 --> 18:31.120
After a few battles,
once he's faced life and death,

18:31.720 --> 18:32.760
he'll learn.

18:32.840 --> 18:33.880
Pay him no mind.

18:35.760 --> 18:36.800
I need to talk to you.

18:36.880 --> 18:39.640
Perfect.
I have something to tell you, too.

18:40.600 --> 18:42.800
Lu Zhuo is always on guard around me.

18:44.320 --> 18:46.760
-I have you to thank for this.
-It's the least I could do.

18:46.840 --> 18:48.440
-Second Young Master.
-Don't follow me!

18:50.120 --> 18:51.240
-Second Young Master.
-Get lost!

18:53.320 --> 18:54.840
You know what to do, right?

18:54.920 --> 18:58.120
That arrogant, inexperienced fool
can't stand being challenged.

18:59.240 --> 19:01.440
Don't worry. With just a few words,

19:01.520 --> 19:05.080
I'll turn those brothers
against each other.

19:06.920 --> 19:08.960
ZHAO

19:15.640 --> 19:16.840
A bystander sees it best.

19:16.920 --> 19:17.920
I'll go talk to them.

19:18.840 --> 19:19.920
Someone! Saddle my horse!

19:30.600 --> 19:32.720
Want to know if she truly loves you?

19:32.800 --> 19:34.360
Why not putting it to a test?

19:39.200 --> 19:43.280
You've seen all my flaws
with your own eyes.

19:44.040 --> 19:45.480
But for some reason,

19:46.240 --> 19:49.920
I want you to remember me
as someone a little kinder,

19:51.160 --> 19:52.760
someone better.

19:57.000 --> 19:58.080
Zhao Song.

20:10.560 --> 20:11.400
Yes.

20:18.800 --> 20:20.520
General, the fog is rolling in.

20:24.360 --> 20:27.200
Sound the drums! Assemble the troops!

20:29.720 --> 20:30.800
ZHAO

20:57.160 --> 20:58.360
All troops, hear my orders!

20:58.440 --> 21:00.400
A thick fog has fallen tonight.

21:00.480 --> 21:02.000
It's perfect for a surprise attack.

21:02.520 --> 21:04.160
Keep silent and secure your armor.

21:04.760 --> 21:06.400
Wrap the horses' hooves
to muffle their steps.

21:06.480 --> 21:08.280
Follow me into the enemy's royal camp!

21:08.360 --> 21:10.080
We'll take the King of Hutuo's head!

21:11.040 --> 21:12.720
Kill ten enemy soldiers,

21:12.800 --> 21:15.240
and you'll earn a promotion
and two bolts of silk!

21:16.160 --> 21:17.560
Kill a hundred,

21:17.640 --> 21:20.800
and you'll rise three ranks
and receive a hundred gold pieces!

21:20.880 --> 21:27.840
-Attack!
-Attack!

21:33.680 --> 21:34.960
Advance!

21:50.960 --> 21:52.360
So that's your game, Lu Zhuo.

21:52.440 --> 21:57.320
You deliberately spread false intelligence
to raid the Hutuo royal camp tonight.

22:00.240 --> 22:01.800
General, what do we do?

22:03.880 --> 22:05.200
Bring me my horse! Now!

22:05.280 --> 22:06.120
Yes! Right away!

22:34.280 --> 22:35.840
Go! Hurry!

22:40.880 --> 22:42.920
The King of Hutuo fled northwest!

22:46.160 --> 22:47.040
Qi Zhongkai.

22:47.920 --> 22:50.040
Don't forget our agreement.

22:50.120 --> 22:51.760
I've never agreed to betray my country.

22:51.840 --> 22:53.280
The Hutuo army must be wiped out!

22:53.800 --> 22:56.080
I haven't forgotten the agreement, either.

23:02.280 --> 23:03.720
He wants both glory and the woman.

23:03.800 --> 23:05.040
His greed knows no bounds.

23:05.560 --> 23:06.960
-Stick to the plan.
-Yes, sir.

23:21.280 --> 23:22.400
Attack!

24:18.560 --> 24:19.560
General!

24:22.800 --> 24:23.800
General!

24:23.880 --> 24:25.520
Deputy General Lu Ya was
hunting down the remnants,

24:25.600 --> 24:27.200
but ran into Wuzhu,
the King of Hutuo's eldest son.

24:27.280 --> 24:28.840
He was lured into Iron Scorpion Ridge.

24:28.920 --> 24:30.760
He's surrounded, and his fate is unknown!

24:30.840 --> 24:31.920
Who gave him permission?

24:34.640 --> 24:35.840
General Xiao.

24:35.920 --> 24:37.280
Take the prisoners back to camp.

24:37.360 --> 24:38.200
I'll go rescue him at Iron Scorpion Ridge.

24:38.280 --> 24:38.920
Yes, sir!

24:39.000 --> 24:40.080
-Move!
-Move!

24:40.600 --> 24:41.440
Move out!

25:11.800 --> 25:13.040
Lu Zhuo, I…

25:13.120 --> 25:14.800
Take mountain trail and retreat, now!

25:14.880 --> 25:17.440
I'm not leaving! I'll stay and cover you!

25:18.040 --> 25:19.840
Lu Ya! Lu Ya, listen to me.

25:19.920 --> 25:20.960
If you don't leave,

25:21.040 --> 25:22.840
-neither of us is getting out alive.
-I won't!

25:22.920 --> 25:25.040
Go! Hurry!

25:25.120 --> 25:26.480
Get them all home safely!

25:28.360 --> 25:30.320
-Go! Hurry!
-Lu Zhuo!

25:44.680 --> 25:46.480
You want to kill me, right?
Come and get me!

25:47.080 --> 25:49.520
Kill Lu Zhuo! Avenge my father!

25:50.480 --> 25:51.760
Kill Lu Zhuo!

26:10.640 --> 26:11.720
General Qi.

26:12.240 --> 26:13.160
I need to get back
to the capital with the news.

26:15.320 --> 26:16.680
Tie him up.

26:21.200 --> 26:22.440
General Qi!

26:29.320 --> 26:31.240
Your Ladyship, we've won a great victory.

26:31.320 --> 26:33.000
Our army is returning in triumph!

27:25.560 --> 27:30.840
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

27:42.200 --> 27:43.160
Grandfather.

27:44.320 --> 27:46.280
My brother didn't let you down.

27:46.920 --> 27:48.440
He won a great victory.

27:49.880 --> 27:53.400
But he went back to save me,
and got trapped behind enemy lines.

27:54.000 --> 27:56.680
He was forced to lead his men straight
into a death trap.

27:56.760 --> 27:58.080
It's all my fault.

27:58.160 --> 27:59.720
I deserve to die, Grandfather!

28:05.520 --> 28:06.800
Zhuo!

28:07.840 --> 28:09.680
Zhuo!

28:10.560 --> 28:12.280
-He's dead.
-Oh, Zhuo!

28:13.640 --> 28:15.960
-Zhuo!
-Zhuo, didn't you promise your mother

28:16.040 --> 28:18.520
you'd come home victorious?

28:21.360 --> 28:22.400
Lord Lu…

28:22.480 --> 28:24.800
Please take Mother with you…

28:29.920 --> 28:32.280
Wei Rao. I'm sorry.

28:32.840 --> 28:34.280
I couldn't bring him home safely.

28:37.840 --> 28:38.960
Where are you going?

28:39.040 --> 28:41.000
I know you can't accept this,
but you have to.

28:41.080 --> 28:42.960
Lu Zhuo is dead.
We have to arrange his funeral.

28:44.000 --> 28:44.960
You're his wife.

28:45.480 --> 28:47.880
No matter how much it hurts,
you have to pull yourself together

28:49.200 --> 28:50.920
and give him the funeral he deserves.

28:57.040 --> 28:57.960
Wei Rao!

29:10.160 --> 29:12.640
ZHUYU ESTATE

29:14.080 --> 29:15.440
Nothing can bring back the dead.

29:15.520 --> 29:16.760
Your Ladyship, my condolences.

29:16.840 --> 29:18.920
It's better to cry than bottle it all up.

29:19.000 --> 29:20.480
-Xiao.
-Your Ladyship.

29:20.560 --> 29:22.560
Gather everyone we can mobilize. Now.

29:22.640 --> 29:24.560
How many can we assemble before sunset?

29:24.640 --> 29:26.160
How many do you need, Your Ladyship?

29:26.240 --> 29:28.560
Zhuyu Estate has 800 strongmen
and 3000 trained soldiers.

29:28.640 --> 29:29.800
If not enough, these two years,

29:29.880 --> 29:32.160
thirty thousand drought refugees
entered the capital.

29:32.240 --> 29:33.800
With frequent outbreaks and earthquakes,

29:33.880 --> 29:35.520
refugees poured westward
from eastern regions.

29:35.600 --> 29:37.280
Eighty thousand around the capital alone.

29:37.360 --> 29:39.800
Among them, at thirty thousand
are able-bodied young adults.

29:40.320 --> 29:41.160
Can we mobilize them?

29:41.960 --> 29:43.560
Folk believe you're divine.

29:44.080 --> 29:45.520
Only a god could survive the plague

29:45.600 --> 29:46.560
and save so many lives.

29:46.640 --> 29:48.320
The Emperor may not rally these people.

29:48.400 --> 29:50.280
But if you call on them, they'll come.

29:50.800 --> 29:52.560
How many troops
guard the capital and palace?

29:52.640 --> 29:54.440
Those loyal to the Crown Prince
and Zheng family

29:54.520 --> 29:55.680
number twenty or thirty thousand.

30:01.280 --> 30:02.600
Sick and starving refugees…

30:03.320 --> 30:05.280
How could they
stand against elite cavalry?

30:07.920 --> 30:09.840
Prepare 200 carrier pigeons. Write…

30:15.000 --> 30:15.920
Your Ladyship.

30:16.960 --> 30:17.800
Your Ladyship!

30:40.400 --> 30:42.440
Your Ladyship,
His Majesty has issued a decree,

30:42.520 --> 30:43.840
by exception, letting the general's coffin
enter the palace,

30:43.920 --> 30:45.160
and have the High Shaman say the rites.

30:45.760 --> 30:47.240
Court will be mourning for five days.

30:47.320 --> 30:48.760
All officials in mourning clothes
for three days.

30:49.280 --> 30:50.640
He'll be posthumously
honored as the Loyal and Valiant,

30:50.720 --> 30:52.280
and buried with the honors of a prince.

30:54.280 --> 30:55.240
Understood.

31:06.160 --> 31:08.000
Once someone's dead, it's all over.

31:09.520 --> 31:11.600
All that's left is an empty shell.

31:13.000 --> 31:15.760
What good does wearing
mourning clothes and crying do?

31:18.600 --> 31:19.440
Leave me.

31:22.560 --> 31:23.720
Get out!

32:02.200 --> 32:03.120
Your Ladyship.

32:03.800 --> 32:05.440
You haven't eaten a thing all day.

32:05.520 --> 32:07.480
Please, have a little soup.

32:10.920 --> 32:12.600
He gave me this.

32:13.800 --> 32:15.760
He picked it out just for me.

32:16.920 --> 32:17.880
Your Ladyship…

32:23.040 --> 32:24.520
As long as Lu Zhuo was alive,

32:26.160 --> 32:28.640
they were terrified of him.

32:34.720 --> 32:36.480
But now he's dead.

32:40.320 --> 32:41.720
He's dead.

32:50.080 --> 32:51.680
I won't let them get away with this.

32:53.440 --> 32:55.320
Those who hurt Lu Zhuo…

32:55.400 --> 32:57.880
I won't let them celebrate! Never!

33:04.880 --> 33:05.840
Aman.

33:08.160 --> 33:09.520
Help me get dressed.

33:16.640 --> 33:18.600
Lu Zhuo is dead?

33:19.440 --> 33:21.440
He's really gone?

33:23.040 --> 33:23.880
Good.

33:25.120 --> 33:26.720
Very good!

33:28.160 --> 33:29.440
Word has come from the palace.

33:29.520 --> 33:32.560
His Majesty was so distraught
that he coughed up blood and passed out.

33:33.160 --> 33:34.280
The palace is in chaos.

33:35.040 --> 33:36.160
Your Highness.

33:36.240 --> 33:38.200
We must act tonight.
There's no time to lose.

33:38.280 --> 33:39.800
I'll take the palace gates.

33:39.880 --> 33:41.680
Your Highness,
lead your men into the inner palace.

33:41.760 --> 33:43.080
Grand Commandant Zheng
will secure the city gates.

33:43.160 --> 33:45.120
By the time everyone wakes at dawn,

33:47.120 --> 33:48.480
it'll all be over.

33:55.520 --> 33:57.640
Your Highness,
shall we march on the palace now?

33:57.720 --> 33:58.880
No.

34:01.880 --> 34:03.760
I'll personally lead my guards

34:04.840 --> 34:07.560
to kill the traitors
at His Majesty's side first.

34:09.560 --> 34:12.360
I'll accompany Your Highness
to Zhuyu Estate.

34:12.440 --> 34:14.320
Use Wei Rao's head as our war offering.

34:14.400 --> 34:16.120
That'll send morale soaring.

34:40.760 --> 34:42.360
Your Highness, we've searched everywhere.

34:42.440 --> 34:45.159
There's not a soul here.
Lady Wu'an is nowhere to be found, either.

34:45.239 --> 34:46.480
Words must have gotten out.

34:46.560 --> 34:47.880
That's why Wei Rao escaped.

34:49.719 --> 34:50.920
Those people…

34:51.000 --> 34:52.400
are long gone into the mountains.

34:52.480 --> 34:53.400
Your Highness.

34:56.600 --> 34:57.480
Something's wrong.

34:57.560 --> 34:59.280
Quick! Get to the palace! Now!

35:07.800 --> 35:10.400
HENGCHENG GATE

35:23.960 --> 35:26.320
HENGCHENG GATE

35:26.400 --> 35:29.680
PRINCE JING'S RESIDENCE

35:35.360 --> 35:38.480
Your Highness.
I've been ordered to escort you.

35:39.120 --> 35:41.680
Ordered? By whom?

35:41.760 --> 35:43.880
Are you part of this rebellion, too?

35:43.960 --> 35:45.760
Your Highness. Please come with us.

35:56.840 --> 35:59.160
I'll go with you.
Leave the women out of this.

35:59.840 --> 36:02.120
Orders are orders. Forgive my disrespect.

36:02.720 --> 36:05.440
Take everyone into custody!

36:07.960 --> 36:08.800
This way, Your Highness.

36:23.720 --> 36:24.800
Unrest is coming to the city.

36:24.880 --> 36:26.280
What should I do?

36:27.160 --> 36:29.600
Hidden rocks lie
beneath the deep currents.

36:29.680 --> 36:31.400
And danger lurks
beyond the path to safety.

36:32.560 --> 36:33.760
The omen says a trapped dragon.

36:35.680 --> 36:37.560
The Crown Prince
has marched into the palace.

36:38.080 --> 36:41.200
If he takes the throne,
we'll lose everything we've worked for!

36:42.240 --> 36:43.560
Fate is what we make of it.

36:44.640 --> 36:46.600
Maybe I shouldn't trust your readings.

36:48.680 --> 36:50.360
A dragon waits beneath the waters,

36:50.440 --> 36:51.800
ready to rise when the time is right.

36:52.320 --> 36:54.480
Your Highness, please be patient.

37:00.160 --> 37:01.560
You're right, my dear.

37:02.720 --> 37:04.440
Gather our men first.

37:05.320 --> 37:07.120
I'll back whoever wins.

37:30.360 --> 37:31.960
XUANSHI PALACE

37:37.400 --> 37:38.920
I heard my father was unwell.

37:39.520 --> 37:40.800
I've come to check on him.

37:40.880 --> 37:42.600
Go inside and inform him.

37:42.680 --> 37:45.960
If Father condemns that wicked consort
and her two children to death,

37:46.040 --> 37:48.600
not a single soldier I've brought
will dare enter and disturb him.

37:53.120 --> 37:54.880
Your Highness.
The victors take the throne.

37:54.960 --> 37:56.040
The losers pay the price.

37:56.600 --> 37:57.960
There's no turning back now.

37:58.040 --> 37:59.560
We've come this far.

38:00.080 --> 38:01.680
Why not storm the palace?

38:03.160 --> 38:04.640
You're just a woman.

38:05.160 --> 38:06.360
What do you know?

38:06.440 --> 38:08.720
I'm the rightful heir,
not some treasonous rebel!

38:08.800 --> 38:10.320
My father is old and sick.

38:10.400 --> 38:12.200
He can't live forever, can he?

38:12.720 --> 38:14.600
Once I secure the sealed abdication edict,

38:14.680 --> 38:16.400
I'll be the rightful new emperor.

38:16.480 --> 38:18.240
The court officials, the common people,

38:18.320 --> 38:21.560
and the feudal lords will
swear me their willing loyalty.

38:23.040 --> 38:24.320
Forgive my ignorance.

38:26.680 --> 38:28.960
A wise man knows when to yield.

38:29.040 --> 38:31.200
Father will make the right choice.

38:32.080 --> 38:33.520
You raise an army in rebellion

38:33.600 --> 38:35.760
and still expect the realm
to loyally submit to you?

38:36.280 --> 38:38.000
Absurdly foolish.

38:38.520 --> 38:39.720
If it were me…

40:53.480 --> 40:56.640
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
